WEBVTT

00:11:00.259 --> 00:11:05.687
we managed to improve
the entire left part of Lubuto's body --

00:11:07.497 --> 00:11:09.518
from the arm,

00:11:09.542 --> 00:11:12.007
to one finger to the other,

00:11:12.999 --> 00:11:15.828
from the leg to the toes.

00:11:16.426 --> 00:11:18.458
Lubuto began to roll over.

00:11:19.111 --> 00:11:21.669
He began to independently sit.

00:11:22.573 --> 00:11:24.569
He was able to crawl,

00:11:24.593 --> 00:11:25.970
stand,

00:11:25.994 --> 00:11:27.251
walk,

00:11:27.275 --> 00:11:28.435
run,

00:11:28.459 --> 00:11:33.037
and now he plays soccer with me
in a more coordinated manner.